      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To ensure safety, always follow the label instructions and dosage guidelines on the Robitussin packaging. Typically, the recommended dose is 5 mL, which contains 10 mg of dextromethorphan. Taking more than the recommended dose can increase the risk of side effects, so it's not recommended to double up. If your cough persists or is severe, you can try taking the medication as directed every 4-6 hours, but be sure to consult your doctor if it does not provide relief within 24-48 hours.",
